@native-marketplace
Feature: Native marketplace input contracts
  Scenario: Marketplace parameters retain native optional values and actionable field diagnostics
    Then marketplace inputs preserve native optional values and report offending fields
  Scenario: Marketplace models retain native contracts and paired graph behavior
    Then marketplace operation models preserve native results graph persistence and paired execution
  Scenario: Marketplace authority receipts cannot cross methods inputs results or runtime identity
    Then marketplace authority receipts bind exact methods inputs results and runtime ownership
  Scenario: Marketplace source references cannot escape their owned roots
    Then marketplace preparation confines local sources resource references and inherited configuration
  Scenario: Marketplace effects must match their acknowledgement and requested configuration change
    Then marketplace effect verification rejects unrelated settings changed sources and false acknowledgements
  Scenario: Marketplace grants remain separate from preferences agents and plugin installation
    Then marketplace management and preference or agent grants cannot enable each other
